  📗
    Changes the todo with *id*: a new title, a new done flag, or both. The
    stored todo is replaced under the lock. Returns the changed todo, or
    nothing when there is no such todo.
  📗
  ❗️ ✏️ id 🔢 title 🍬🔡 done 🍬👌 ➡️ 🍬🗒 🍇
    🖍🆕 changed 🍬🗒
    🤷‍♀️ ➡️ 🖍changed
    🔒 lock❗️
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 📏 todos❓❗️ 🍇
      🐽 todos i❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕todo
      ↪️ 🆔 todo❗️ 🙌 id 🍇
        ↪️ title ➡️ newTitle 🍇
          ✍️ todo newTitle❗️ ➡️ 🖍todo
        🍉
        ↪️ done ➡️ newDone 🍇
          ☑️ todo newDone❗️ ➡️ 🖍todo
        🍉
        todo ➡️ 🐽todos i❗️
        todo ➡️ 🖍changed
      🍉
    🍉
    🔓 lock❗️
    ↩️ changed
  🍉

  ❗️ 🔥 id 🔢 ➡️ 👌 🍇
    🔒 lock❗️
    -1 ➡️ 🖍🆕index
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 📏 todos❓❗️ 🍇
      ↪️ 🆔 🐽 todos i❗️❗️ 🙌 id 🍇
        i ➡️ 🖍index
      🍉
    🍉
    ↪️ index ▶️🙌 0 🍇
      🐨 todos index❗️
    🍉
    🔓 lock❗️
    ↩️ index ▶️🙌 0
  🍉
🍉

📗
  /todos: the Nest-style controller.

    GET    /todos           list (optional ?done=true|false)
    GET    /todos/:id       one todo or 404
    POST   /todos           {"title": "..."} → 201
    PUT    /todos/:id       {"title"?: "...", "done"?: bool}
    DELETE /todos/:id       204 or 404
